              "text": "अत्यंत — atyant — \"extremely (formal)\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "अगर रोगी की हालत अत्यंत गंभीर होगी तो उसे अस्पताल ले जाना पड़ेगा। agar rogī kī hālat atyant gambhīr hogī to use aspatāl le jānā paṛegā. If the patient's condition is extremely serious, he will have to be taken to hospital."
            }
          ]
        },
